{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "db71cdb9-8b41-8c21-8d04-36f5ba948e75",
  "created_at": "2025-12-21T10:33:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith Sisson",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:31:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. I know is Sunday, City Hall is closed, so I call the storm line like the recording say. I have a problem with the drain in front of my building."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:31:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's what this line is for. Where are you calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:31:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two forty-one Ruggles Avenue, in the Historic Hill. I am the landlord, I own the building. The storm drain in the street, it is gurgling, you know, making noise, and a smell comes up from it. Like sewer. Very bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:32:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, gurgling, sewer smell, 241 Ruggles. Is there water coming up out of it, or just the noise and smell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is some water, yes. And it is moving down the street toward the neighbor garage. Not inside yet, but is going that way. This rain was Wednesday into Thursday, three days ago, and still the drain is like this. Is not draining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:32:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, so water's collecting and heading toward the neighbor's garage. Writing that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:32:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Can I ask, is this a city drain or a state one? Because somebody told me before maybe is the state and nobody does nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:32:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't want to wait again for somebody to say is not theirs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:32:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair question. Ruggles is a city street, so I'd treat it as ours and get it logged for a crew to look at. If it turns out to be something else, we pass it along ourselves, you don't have to chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:33:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. Because I cannot stay long, I drive a school bus, I have my route in one hour. I have to get ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:33:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, we're almost done. Do you want a call back at the number we have, or is there a better one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:33:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, call me at four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:33:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-three. Perfect. I'm marking it as water moving toward a neighbor's property, so it goes up the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:33:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please, somebody has to come, because this keeps happening when it rains and I am tired to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:33:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in the system now, and someone will reach out to you. Drive safe out there today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T10:33:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. Bye."
    }
  ],
